WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:06.320
It's most often the case that a&nbsp;
nation's greatest war is with itself

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:12.240
over whether or not it can make the hard&nbsp;
decisions needed to sustain success.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:17.040
As for what we need to do, it&nbsp;
comes down to just two things:

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.600
earn more than we spend and treat each other well.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.320
All other things I mention,

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:28.720
strong education, inventiveness,&nbsp;
being competitive, and all the rest,

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:31.760
are just ways of getting at these two things.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.960
It's easy to measure if we're doing them.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:41.280
So like people who want to get fit, let's&nbsp;
get on the program and improve our vitals.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.600
Let's do that individually and collectively.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:52.348
Thank you, and may the force&nbsp;
of evolution be with you.

